<title>USA: Itronics names Stumbo CFO.</title>
<headline>Itronics names Stumbo CFO.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Itronics Inc said Friday it named Richard Stumbo its vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He assumes duties that had been handled by President and Chief Operating Officer John Whitney.</p>
<p>Itronics said Stumbo, a director of the company since 1995, has held various financial positions at large companies, and owned and operated a business services company from 1993 to 1997.</p>
